<title>USA: Armenia seeks 65,000 T PL 480 HRW wheat - U.S. agent.</title>
<headline>Armenia seeks 65,000 T PL 480 HRW wheat - U.S. agent.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Armenia is seeking about 65,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat under the PL 480 program for January 23-February 6 delivery, its U.S. export agent said.  </p>
<p>Offers are to be submitted on January 15 and will be valid until January 16.</p>
<p>The wheat would be in bulk, U.S. No. 2 or better hard red winter, ordinary protein, with maximum moisture of 13.5 percent.</p>
<p>Contracts will be awarded on the basis of maximum five percent less at buyer's option.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
